# Redirect rules for Cloudflare's static asset layer.
#
# What does NOT belong here:
#  - trailing-slash normalisation — wrangler.jsonc html_handling does it
#  - www → apex — that is a zone-level Redirect Rule (dashboard), because it
#    fires before the request reaches this worker's hostname at all
#  - /hi/<code> — that is a REWRITE (URL must stay in the address bar), which
#    lives in worker/index.ts, not a redirect
#
# What does: legacy paths from previous versions of the site. Always 301
# (permanent) so link authority transfers. Example kept from the ancestor site
# — a merged page keeps its old URL working forever:
# /cookies /privacy-policy 301
